  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZS9rcCXvHe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Join-5865F2?logo=discord\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/superiormc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Patreon-Support-FF424D?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\">)</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌍 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>世界生成全面重製：</strong></span></em> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">更多內容請見截圖頁面</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b1e82b6c-5e6c-4852-9c2a-d7709966851d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📜 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>龐大任務線：</strong></span></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>超過 500 個任務與 100 多個首領</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b37ed76f-4904-4534-9b30-23cf6b5f5db3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🛡️ <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>自訂職業系統：</strong></span> </em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">14 種職業，配備自訂經驗值與技能介面</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0813bffb-8b9d-4b82-918a-1fc8230bfe34.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>🏹 </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>廣闊的技能樹：</strong></span></em></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">超過 250 項完全自訂的能力</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dd124415-1b9e-44b8-b910-ba34371db6d7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🐍 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>30 多種可召喚寵物：</strong></span></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">從蛇、靈魂禿鷹、雪豹到老虎、長牙獸與電流貓</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a6975765-9cb9-4c7a-9d67-1408edd50cf0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🛒 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>大型商店系統：</strong></span></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">數百種道具，大幅減少單調乏味的重複刷取</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6bb3ce0c-7f2a-4b90-a863-0c185f2ad99e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⚔️ <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>裝備改造全面重製：</strong></span></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">自訂系統模擬《流放之路》等 ARPG 遊戲</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2faa721d-979d-47c4-ab4e-a8835e495e9f.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f85ca9fe-2bae-4042-92d7-a9c1d99b6e91.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b1635ed9-2c87-4979-989c-8fcc2f53b424.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"450\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_20405704-e22d-46fc-b58d-8a894d73110c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"689\" height=\"500\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cc13d97a-9f71-40ca-914f-8fab7fcf291b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"765\" height=\"555\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌀 <em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">自訂技能圖騰系統：</span></strong></em></span> 與技能樹技能互相搭配，打造數百種完全不同的混合流派&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c8b2c8d9-3988-4df1-b09b-103d72b034c1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">👹 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>重新設計的首領：</strong></span></em></span> 許多原本單調的首領（如監守者）已徹底重做，擁有更具吸引力的機制</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8dbaf83a-9bcd-4b2c-aa6f-223a4ea0edd2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"494\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_acd4774e-c8c6-4b20-9edc-7e60cdab7327.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"634\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">☢️ <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>28 種遊戲玩法調整項目：</strong></span></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">法師、隱形蜘蛛與核子爬行者</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f915cccd-8b50-4fbc-b72c-0deb50ecf058.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">💎 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>自訂奇物、藥水效果與武器：</strong></span></em> </span> 獨特的效果與隱藏特性</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_06b70fbf-5935-40d8-a8e9-fe33874dacdd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293866/description_99b5ff0c-43c8-4bb9-9270-9a59b99c36a4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🧩 其他亮點：</span></h3>\n<p>🪄 數十種其他獨特機制，例如<strong>施法寵物</strong>、寶箱、背包升級、具有無限組合的<strong>首領變體</strong>、奇物槽位擴展、<strong>數百種自訂配方</strong>、自訂礦石鑄造，以及更多更多</p>\n<p>✅ 支援<strong>Distant Horizons</strong> <em>（非內建）</em></p>\n<p>🤝 為<strong>多人遊戲</strong>體驗而設計</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">⚙️ 由 \\*\\*數萬行\\*\\* 手寫 KubeJS 腳本驅動</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">想和朋友一起玩 Superior 嗎？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">我們推薦使用 <em><strong>Wabbanode</strong></em> 進行<strong>穩定</strong>且<strong>順暢</strong>的伺服器託管 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252fpartner%252fsuperior\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293866/description_34d4c87d-8ab2-4c1f-9dff-2b5e9632c129.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
